esign Western-Japanese fusion fashion for my OC.\n\nIf possible, I would like a pet similar to a little deep-sea ghost, as well as flower decorations with a jellyfish-like texture.But everything is up to your aesthetic!\nIf the content is inappropriate, please cancel it! If the amount is not enough, please resend the request. Thank you very much!\n\ncharacter:\ngentle and quiet pink hair:medusa(Turritopsis dohrnii (the immortal jellyfish))，Director of the Underwater Museum.\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1N4rTAKX1GRCFHAS6MniD2R0c3XN_4KhD\nUse: personal viewing, personal non-commercial printing.", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@mlii_nj/works/14", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/9ae441a3/uploads/origins/113ad8e2-ec1d-48c7-96c8-d1f6f62b1a90?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=2b9eebe16e19fc4d44443c2366398336", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/9ae441a3/uploads/origins/113ad8e2-ec1d-48c7-96c8-d1f6f62b1a90?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=2b9eebe16e19fc4d44443c2366398336, https://si.imgix.net/9ae441a3/uploads/origins/113ad8e2-ec1d-48c7-96c8-d1f6f62b1a90?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=e94132b926625ae2fd0528d328b8e190 2x, https://si.imgix.net/9ae441a3/uploads/origins/113ad8e2-ec1d-48c7-96c8-d1f6f62b1a90?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=de2aae4c61fc5777acbbc60378a67a15 3x"}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_i